[[0,3249556,0,1,0,1,"2019-05-30T05:44:11","RandomBOT","",[],"","Check out this very cool link of past shabbos goyim","https://www.timesofisrael.com/obama-elvis-and-5-other-famous-shabbos-goys/","whatever"],[1,18905730,0,0,0,0,"2019-05-30T05:55:10","RandomBOT","",[],"<p><a href=\"http://cosmos.ucc.ie/cs1064/jabowen/IPSC/php/art.php?aid=6397\">Found this by going down a rabbit hole around, Wir Juden (We Jews) a 1934 book by German rabbi Joachim Prinz.</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wir_Juden\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wir_Juden</a>\r\n<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joachim_Prinz\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joachim_Prinz</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As his prominence grew in Germany and his fears of Hitler's reign coming to fruition, he earned the sponsorship of Rabbi Stephen Wise who was a close adviser to President Franklin Roosevelt.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franklin_D._Roosevelt\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franklin_D._Roosevelt</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He also initiated the development of the world's first atomic bomb and worked with the other Allied leaders to lay the groundwork for the United Nations and other post-war institutions. Roosevelt won reelection in 1944 but with his physical health declining during the war years, he died in April 1945, just 11 weeks into his fourth term. The Axis Powers surrendered to the Allies in the months following Roosevelt's death, during the presidency of Roosevelt's successor, Harry S. Truman.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_S._Truman\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harry_S._Truman</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>While living in Independence, he served as a Shabbos goy for Jewish neighbors, doing tasks for them on Shabbat that their religion prevented them from doing on that day.[13][14][15]</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<p>How far back does this go?</p>"],[1,18905788,0,0,0,0,"2019-05-30T06:02:57","voatusernamevoat","",[],"<p>elvis was jewish by his mom, roosevelt jewish, gore jew, obama purportedly jew as well.</p>"]]
